"P3519789186" "We still haven't received any word from Mirror Spirit regarding the Circle, so that's...hopefully a good sign.<br><br>I've got <color yellow>Detective Frasenbacker</color> in Faultline tracking any movements in the area from the Vahzilok. That leaves you to focus on the threat of the Clockwork.<br><br><color LightGreen>I've gotten word that there's a large battle going on right now in Faultline between the Clockwork and the Lost.</color><br><br>What exactly it is, I'm not sure, but witnesses say the Clockwork were yelling something about their 'princess'. Sounds familiar, right?<br><br>You'll all need to go there and see what exactly is going on."
