// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2549403618" "Speak with Mirror Spirit regarding the Circle"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2522129966" "So the Circle are on the move? It's best if you speak to Mirror Spirit to see if she knows anything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1680478070" "{TaskForceName}, I was hoping you would come see me. Yes, I'm aware that you fought the Circle in that supergroup base. I apologize that I was not able to inform you ahead of time.<br><br>An entrance to Oranbega has appeared within Faultline. It can only mean that the Circle are on the move once again. I can tell you where to find this entrance. <color green>From there, it will be up to you to go in there and stop whatever they are doing.</color> I will let the PPD know that the Clockwork are on the move as well."

