"P3595065180" "Madness Mage"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1720882500" "Assembler Prince"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1204854987" "We've come too far to let some piles of tin blow up our plans!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P758660332" "King won't let you get your hands on that power! We'll protect the Princess!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1390202205" "Set the bomb! Blow them all up, create the Princess' new kingdom!"
