// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P613320271" "Foolish Longbow! You cannot stop our new power!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3390663553" "Hold them back! Do you hear me?! HOLD THEM BACK!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1969165809" "Kzzt Bzzt"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2243027461" "The King will not be stopped by these underlings!"
